{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Houses sometimes need to be put up and sometimes need to be torn down - we present to you a demolition game like never before!\ud83d\udc77\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udc77\u200d\u2640\ufe0f </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f<strong>Demolition</strong> - now you can demolish prepared houses! We enable you to do this in various ways - demolition with a ball, excavator, or maybe explosives? Choose what you are most satisfied with!\ud83d\udca3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd28<strong>Deconstruction</strong> - demolition isn't just about knocking down walls, breaking windows, and scraping off tiles - it's the conscientious removal of door frames, panels, and priceless ornaments. Use a hammer, drill, and torch to do it perfectly! \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcd6<strong>Delve into the story</strong> - demolition always has a purpose - sometimes the building poses a danger to outsiders, and sometimes it reveals amazing treasures or secrets\ud83d\udd75</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u267b\ufe0f<strong>Ecology</strong> - ecology is a hot topic these days - and we support it too! - interact with the environment by twisting things to recycle them for use in future projects\u2705</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude9a\ud83d\ude9b<strong>Moving out</strong> - in our old house many things remind us of our most beautiful moments spent with our family or with ourselves - sentiment is very important - it would be a shame to leave everything behind. Bring out your belongings to make a full-fledged move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">House Builder has a story mode. Deconstruction levels will unlock as the story progresses - that is, if you reach a level from the storyline of, for example, Lighthouse, you will automatically unlock a second level - Deconstruction of the Lighthouse. If you have any questions, let me know</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3348130?t=1742563910","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3348130?t=1742563910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348130/9dd79c3ab391acc694b29690740472eec735f88c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742563910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348130/9dd79c3ab391acc694b29690740472eec735f88c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742563910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Houses sometimes need to be put up and sometimes need to be torn down - we present to you a demolition game like never before!\ud83d\udc77\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udc77\u200d\u2640\ufe0f </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f<strong>Demolition</strong> - now you can demolish prepared houses! We enable you to do this in various ways - demolition with a ball, excavator, or maybe explosives? Choose what you are most satisfied with!\ud83d\udca3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd28<strong>Deconstruction</strong> - demolition isn't just about knocking down walls, breaking windows, and scraping off tiles - it's the conscientious removal of door frames, panels, and priceless ornaments. Use a hammer, drill, and torch to do it perfectly! \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcd6<strong>Delve into the story</strong> - demolition always has a purpose - sometimes the building poses a danger to outsiders, and sometimes it reveals amazing treasures or secrets\ud83d\udd75</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u267b\ufe0f<strong>Ecology</strong> - ecology is a hot topic these days - and we support it too! - interact with the environment by twisting things to recycle them for use in future projects\u2705</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude9a\ud83d\ude9b<strong>Moving out</strong> - in our old house many things remind us of our most beautiful moments spent with our family or with ourselves - sentiment is very important - it would be a shame to leave everything behind. Bring out your belongings to make a full-fledged move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">House Builder has a story mode. Deconstruction levels will unlock as the story progresses - that is, if you reach a level from the storyline of, for example, Lighthouse, you will automatically unlock a second level - Deconstruction of the Lighthouse. If you have any questions, let me know</p>","developers":["FreeMind S.A."],"fullgame":{"appid":"1244630","name":"House Builder"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348130/header.jpg?t=1742563910","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116790,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116790/movie480.mp4?t=1742483790","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116790/movie_max.mp4?t=1742483790"},"name":"House Builder - The Deconstruction DLC Launch Trailer","thumbn